[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/30.tres]大乔（桥氏）[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]基本信息：[/color]

[indent]•  生卒年：均不详[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  籍贯：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "庐江", "cat": "geography"}]庐江[/url][/color]郡皖县（今安徽省安庆市潜山）[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  身份：桥公（疑为[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "桥蕤", "cat": "people"}]桥蕤[/url][/color]）之女，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "小乔", "cat": "people"}]小乔[/url][/color]之姐，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙策", "cat": "people"}]孙策[/url][/color]之妻（名分存争议，正妻or妾，永不可确证）[/indent]
